| **PieceMesh blob loading** | [Line 37935](compose/sketchpad/index.tsx#L37935) | Async blob URL retrieval with fallback box geometry |
| **Three.js loaders** | [Lines 40679, 40721](compose/sketchpad/index.tsx#L40679-L40721) | `useGLTF()` and `useFBX()` consume blob URLs |
